{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o055c","title":"曹丕崩嘉福殿","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o055c-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"曹丕崩嘉福殿","evidence":["wendi-e-o055c-q"]},{"id":"wendi-a-p003-xiangshu","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"《魏略》记高元吕言四十有小苦，后叙曹丕四十而薨；非确定预言事实。","evidence":["wendi-q-p003-xiangshu"]},{"id":"fangji-a-7e8a501ad7b33c6e50e6","label":"正文","text":"文帝黄初七年年四十病困，谓左右曰“建平所言八十，谓昼夜也，吾其决矣”，顷之果崩","evidence":["fangji-q-236801e71b57df81e538"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"去世","evidence":["wendi-e-o055c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":226,"label":"黄初七年五月丁巳","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y226","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o054","basis":"黄初七年五月丁巳"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o055c-q","wendi-q-o054","wendi-q-o049","wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o055c-q","source_order":[2,489,"O055c"],"order":678}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-236801e71b57df81e538","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-ae66f32ef98e75826523","layer":"original","quote":"文帝，黄初七年，年四十，病困；谓左右曰：“建平所言八十，谓昼夜也，吾其决矣〖13〗！”顷之，果崩","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wendi-e-o055c-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-de99b91993873e12670a","layer":"original","quote":"丁巳〖6〗，帝崩于嘉福殿。时年四十。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":488,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":96},{"id":"wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：黄初六年（公元 225）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":467,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-61512c4ade75d71d6a76","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o049","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-d5847039c2d504d36e8e","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，遣使者循行许昌以东，尽沛郡〖2〗。问民所疾苦，贫者赈贷之。﹝一﹞三月，行幸召陵〖3〗，通讨虏渠〖4〗。乙巳〖5〗，还许昌宫。并州刺史梁习讨鲜卑轲比能〖6〗，大破之。辛未〖7〗，帝为舟师，东征。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105},{"id":"wendi-q-o054","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-19250f15bc304637f90e","layer":"original","quote":"七年春正月，将幸许昌。许昌城南门，无故自崩；帝心恶之，遂不入。壬子〖1〗，行还洛阳宫。三月，筑九华台〖2〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":487,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"wendi-q-p003-xiangshu","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-bd36f2c3157825e6fc56","layer":"pei","quote":"后无几而立为王太子，至年四十而薨。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-9c94c196c48239285555","start":83,"end":100}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
